    inline_cta("Planning an interior refresh in Riverview?", "/services/interior-painting/", "See Interior Painting"),
    a_h2("Exterior Painting Costs in Riverview"),
    a_p("Exterior painting in Riverview costs more than the national average for one simple reason: Florida's climate demands better products and far more thorough preparation. Most Riverview homes are concrete block and stucco (CBS), which generally falls in the middle of the ranges below. Wood-sided and older homes that need scraping and wood repair sit at the higher end."),
