    a_p("A trustworthy estimate is itemized and specific. It should name the exact products (brand and product line, not just \"paint\"), state the number of coats, describe the prep scope, list what will be protected, and spell out the cleanup and warranty terms. Vague one-line quotes are a red flag."),
